Theorem 1.2 gives a parametrization of all quartic rings with their cubic resolvents. Most
cubic rings are not generated by one element as a Z-algebra, but the special cubic rings which
are generated by one element are called monogenic. Our Theorem 1.1 gives a parametrization
of quartic rings with monogenic cubic resolvents. Alternatively, Theorem 1.1 can be viewed
