   362	three-node row.  There are two independent conditional obstructions: §4
   363	excludes the required one-place `(2,15)` infinity germ, while (6.1)--(6.2)
   364	uses only one place at infinity, multiplicity two there, irreducibility, and
   365	the requirement that every affine singularity be a node.
   366	
   367	## 7. Verdict and quantified scope
   368	
   369	**Verdict: OPEN at
   370	`OPEN[PI1S4-(6,4)-TRIPLE-COVER-GLOBAL-MONOGENICITY]`; behind it lies
   371	`OPEN[PI1S4-(6,4)-TRIPLE-COVER-HIGH-DEGREE-CANCELLATION]`.**
   372	
   373	The resolvent quotient does prove, uniformly for every hypothetical `phi`, a
   374	connected finite-flat `S_3` triple cover with reduced discriminant exactly
   375	`D`.  It proves the four-coefficient identity (2.2), not a one-variable
   376	cubic.  Projective-module freeness is insufficient for a global power basis,
   377	as the locally monogenic counterexample in §2 shows.  Even after a power
   378	basis is added, an irreducible one-place/nodal argument is still needed to
   379	exclude Davenport--Stothers cancellation and obtain degrees `(2,3)`.
   380	
   381	On the other hand, the work after those two gaps is complete: the leading
   382	identity is fully classified, its infinity germs are exhausted, and both §4
   383	and §6 prove that **no** bounded-degree depressed cubic can have the charged
   384	row data.  Thus proving the two named lemmas would promote this route to a
   385	uniform **KILLED** verdict.  Without them, calling the row killed would use an
   386	unproved reduction; calling it `SURVIVES` would be equally wrong, because no
   387	general Miranda triple-cover family with the required branch curve has been
   388	exhibited.
   389	
   390	The unconditional reduction and the conditional contradictions use only
   391	`phi`, irreducibility/nodality, and the numerical infinity type.  They do not
   392	use the fold witness or any particular placement of the three nodes.  Hence
   393	the quantified scope is the whole `(6,4)` row carrying such an `S_4`
   394	representation, exactly as requested.  No exit-price assertion is made.
